                <h1 class="text_size_four_extra_large font_weight_bold letter_spacing_tight text_gray_nine_hundred small_text_size_six_extra_large">Interiors shaped around the way you live</h1>
                <p class="margin_top_six text_size_large line_height_eight text_gray_six_hundred">
                  Maison North Design is about creating interiors that feel thoughtful, comfortable and connected to the people who call them home. The design process can consider how a space is used, how natural and artificial light move through it, and how colour, texture and furniture work together. Rather than relying on a single look, each interior can be guided by the property’s character and the client’s own preferences. From early ideas to the finer details, the focus is on making
                  considered choices that bring clarity and cohesion to a home. Explore an approach to interior design that balances visual character with everyday function, for spaces across England.
                </p>
                <div class="margin_top_ten flexbox_container items_center_position gap_x_six">
